# No crontab entry is required by the working-memory system.
#
# Reminders are created directly in Todoist, which notifies your devices; the
# 5-minute reminder-check tick that used to live here was removed on
# 2026-08-29 along with the local reminder store.
#
# IF YOU ARE UPGRADING and previously installed that line, REMOVE IT --
# otherwise cron invokes a script that no longer exists, every five minutes:
#
#     crontab -e      # then delete the line mentioning reminder-check.py
#
# The remaining scheduled work is registered inside Hermes, not the OS
# crontab: the nightly consolidation gate, the nightly backup push, and the
# monthly cron-session prune. See README / setup.sh output.
